                <pb facs="0105" n="98" sameAs="frus:frus1894Nicaragua/pg98"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Incloaure 2 in No. 58.]</seg></opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Baker to Captain Watson.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Managua</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1894-06-04"><hi rendition="#italic">June 4,
                        1894</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Have not yet received instructions referred to. Latest mail left New York May 10.
                    Argüello still at liberty. Lacayo still in power, although President has
                    personally promised his removal. Torres removed. Advise me.</p>
            </div>
        </body>
